    <string name="friend_title_5">Soul friends</string>
    <string name="friend_text_0_0">Every great friendship starts small. Time for an adventure together!</string>
    <string name="friend_text_0_1">The chemistry needs a little warm-up – a shared laughing fit works wonders.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_0_2">Maybe you just don't know each other well enough yet. That can change!</string>
    <string name="friend_text_1_0">There's something there – but you still have lots to discover about each other.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_1_1">A few shared inside jokes and this will be really good.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_1_2">More time together, less time on your phones – then it'll click.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_2_0">You're a solid team. It's rarely boring with you two.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_2_1">Good talks, good vibes – people can count on you.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_2_2">A relaxed friendship with plenty of room to grow even closer.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_3_0">You often understand each other without words. That's true friendship.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_3_1">With you two, every evening becomes a story to tell later.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_3_2">You're there for each other – even when things get tough.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_4_0">Best friends through and through. You share laughs, secrets and snacks.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_4_1">Where one goes, the other isn't far. An unbeatable duo!</string>
    <string name="friend_text_4_2">You know each other's favourite songs, quirks and dreams.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_5_0">Soul friends! A connection like this is rare.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_5_1">You're like two halves of a very funny whole.</string>
    <string name="friend_text_5_2">This friendship lasts a lifetime – at least.</string>
